<h1 data-copy-en="Chloe" data-copy-zh="Chloe">Chloe</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Academy lessons, four-destination event route and private visits." data-copy-zh="学院课程、四地事件路线与私人探访。">Academy lessons, four-destination event route and private visits.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Personal_and_Shared_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="H2H_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Why_I_Qualified"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Idle_Time"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Score_for_This"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="H2H_Special_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Chloe — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/chloe.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Chloe — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/chloe.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Chloe — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Chloe’s current route alternates between the Academy, NutriMax plaza, Transportation Hub and her tower. Researching is an early one-time lesson; the later private visit has its own story and H2H checks.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Meeting_Chloe_and_Following_Her_Schedule"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="H2H_Chain_and_Start_Locations"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><ul><li>Cognitive Optimization Academy: 08:00–11:00 / 15:00–20:00.</li><li>NutriMax Optimization Plaza: 11:00–15:00; The Correct Answer completed.</li><li>Optimal Living Tower Alpha: 20:00–24:00; Provisional Placement completed.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Best_Plot_Choices"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Follow the personal events in order. At Close Friend (200), Provisional Placement occurs at the Prime Transportation Nexus Hub from 09:00–19:00, rather than at her normal portrait location.</p><p>Private Time requires Intimate (1600), Fourteen Thousand Hours and the No Score for This H2H. Start at the tower from 20:00–24:00, once a day. There is no separate 6000-point requirement.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Quantum Achievements</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cognitive Optimization Academy; 08:00–11:00 or 15:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chloe +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Correct Answer</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cognitive Optimization Academy; 08:00–11:00 or 15:00–20:00; Chloe Acknowledged (10); Quantum Achievements</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chloe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Unstructured Question</th><td data-label="Requirements">NutriMax Optimization Plaza; 11:00–15:00; Chloe Known (25); The Correct Answer</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chloe +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Useful Mistake</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cognitive Optimization Academy; 08:00–11:00 or 15:00–20:00; Chloe Acquaintance (50); The Unstructured Question</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chloe +7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cohort Review</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cognitive Optimization Academy; 08:00–11:00 or 15:00–20:00; Chloe Friend (100); The Useful Mistake</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chloe +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Provisional Placement</th><td data-label="Requirements">Prime Transportation Nexus Hub; 09:00–19:00; Chloe Close Friend (200); Cohort Review</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chloe +9</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Preference Form</th><td data-label="Requirements">Optimal Living Tower Alpha; 20:00–24:00; Chloe Crush (400); Provisional Placement</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chloe +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Attachment Variance</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cognitive Optimization Academy; 08:00–11:00 or 15:00–20:00; Chloe Romantic (800); Preference Form</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chloe +11</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Fourteen Thousand Hours</th><td data-label="Requirements">Optimal Living Tower Alpha; 20:00–24:00; Chloe Romantic (800); Attachment Variance</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chloe +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Question It Missed</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cognitive Optimization Academy; 08:00–11:00 or 15:00–20:00; Chloe Intimate (1600); Fourteen Thousand Hours</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chloe +13</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Her Own Curriculum</th><td data-label="Requirements">Cognitive Optimization Academy; 08:00–11:00 or 15:00–20:00; Chloe In Love (3000); The Question It Missed</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chloe +15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Different Tracks</th><td data-label="Requirements">NutriMax Optimization Plaza; 11:00–15:00; Chloe Friend (100); Tiffany Friend (100); Cohort Review</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Chloe +5; Tiffany +5</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Actions_and_Lessons"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><details><summary>Action costs, requirements and rewards</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Chloe</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cognitive Optimization Academy / NutriMax Optimization Plaza / Optimal Living Tower Alpha</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Book</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cognitive Optimization Academy / NutriMax Optimization Plaza / Optimal Living Tower Alpha; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Book</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+8 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolate</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cognitive Optimization Academy / NutriMax Optimization Plaza / Optimal Living Tower Alpha; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Chocolate</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+5 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Learn Researching</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cognitive Optimization Academy; Known (25); Intelligence 35</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">150 min; −35 Energy; −20 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+10 base affection; Researching; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Question Framing</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cognitive Optimization Academy; Friend (100); Intelligence 45; The Useful Mistake</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; requires 12 Energy and 5 Calm available. Energy and Calm are not spent.</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+8 direct affection; Perception +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Why I Qualified</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cognitive Optimization Academy; Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −15 Energy; −5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Idle Time</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cognitive Optimization Academy / Optimal Living Tower Alpha; Close Friend (200); Why I Qualified</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −10 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Recreation Credit Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cognitive Optimization Academy; Close Friend (200); Cohort Review; Academy 08:00–11:00 or 15:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $100; −30 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +5 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Score for This</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Cognitive Optimization Academy; Crush (400); Idle Time</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −20 Energy; −10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Unscheduled Night Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Optimal Living Tower Alpha; Romantic (800); Attachment Variance; Tower 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $120; −35 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +5 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Time</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Optimal Living Tower Alpha; Intimate (1600); Fourteen Thousand Hours; No Score for This; Tower 20:00–24:00; full version</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">private visit; 1/day</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>The repeated Talk, Book and Chocolate actions share their daily limits across her locations. Only the Academy offers the Researching lesson and Question Framing. Idle Time is available at the Academy and tower.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: relationship bonuses</summary><p>Meeting each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 to ordinary base affection before the remaining relationship bonuses. The favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct one-time affection rewards are added as listed.</p><p>Intelligence 85; Perception 80; Communication 75</p><p>Favorite skill: Researching</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Listed time and resources are base values; applicable skills, difficulty and active bonuses can change the shown cost or affection. Base affection, direct affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Missing tower portrait: finish Provisional Placement, then return from 20:00 onward.</li><li>The recreation date starts only at 08:00–11:00 or 15:00–18:00 because of her Academy schedule.</li><li>For a missing next scene, check the prior event, required H2H and the destination in the navigation table.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="skills.html">Researching and lessons</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Prime routes</a></li><li><a href="character-tiffany.html">Tiffany</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Personal_and_Shared_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-H2H_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Why_I_Qualified"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Idle_Time"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Score_for_This"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-H2H_Special_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Chloe 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/chloe.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Chloe 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/chloe.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Chloe 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Chloe 的现行路线会在学院、NutriMax 广场、交通枢纽与居住塔之间切换。研究技能可在前期学习一次，后期私人探访则有独立的剧情与谈心前置。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Meeting_Chloe_and_Following_Her_Schedule"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-H2H_Chain_and_Start_Locations"></span><h2>在哪里找到</h2><ul><li>认知优化学院: 08:00–11:00 / 15:00–20:00.</li><li>NutriMax优化广场: 11:00–15:00; 正确答案后开放。</li><li>最优生活塔Alpha: 20:00–24:00; 临时职位分配后开放。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Best_Plot_Choices"></span><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>个人事件需按顺序完成。亲密朋友（200）阶段的临时职位分配在 核心区交通枢纽 09:00–19:00 触发，不在她的常规肖像地点。</p><p>私密时光要求亲密（1600）、完成一万四千小时，以及「这件事不计分」谈心。每天可在居住塔 20:00–24:00 开始一次，没有额外的 6000 分要求。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">量子成就</th><td data-label="条件">认知优化学院; 08:00–11:00 或 15:00–20:00</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chloe +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">正确答案</th><td data-label="条件">认知优化学院; 08:00–11:00 或 15:00–20:00; Chloe 已遇见 (10); 量子成就</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chloe +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">非结构化问题</th><td data-label="条件">NutriMax优化广场; 11:00–15:00; Chloe 已知 (25); 正确答案</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chloe +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">有用的错误</th><td data-label="条件">认知优化学院; 08:00–11:00 或 15:00–20:00; Chloe 相识 (50); 非结构化问题</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chloe +7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">同届评审</th><td data-label="条件">认知优化学院; 08:00–11:00 或 15:00–20:00; Chloe 朋友 (100); 有用的错误</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chloe +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">临时职位分配</th><td data-label="条件">核心区交通枢纽; 09:00–19:00; Chloe 亲密朋友 (200); 同届评审</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chloe +9</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">偏好表格</th><td data-label="条件">最优生活塔Alpha; 20:00–24:00; Chloe 迷恋 (400); 临时职位分配</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chloe +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">依恋变异</th><td data-label="条件">认知优化学院; 08:00–11:00 或 15:00–20:00; Chloe 浪漫感 (800); 偏好表格</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chloe +11</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一万四千小时</th><td data-label="条件">最优生活塔Alpha; 20:00–24:00; Chloe 浪漫感 (800); 依恋变异</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chloe +12</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">系统漏掉的问题</th><td data-label="条件">认知优化学院; 08:00–11:00 或 15:00–20:00; Chloe 亲密 (1600); 一万四千小时</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chloe +13</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她自己的课程</th><td data-label="条件">认知优化学院; 08:00–11:00 或 15:00–20:00; Chloe 恋爱中 (3000); 系统漏掉的问题</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chloe +15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不同的道路</th><td data-label="条件">NutriMax优化广场; 11:00–15:00; Chloe 朋友 (100); Tiffany 朋友 (100); 同届评审</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Chloe +5; Tiffany +5</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Actions_and_Lessons"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><details><summary>行动消耗、条件与奖励</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与 Chloe 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">认知优化学院／NutriMax优化广场／最优生活塔Alpha</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 5次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送书</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">认知优化学院／NutriMax优化广场／最优生活塔Alpha; 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10 分钟; 1 书</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+8 基础好感度; 1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">认知优化学院／NutriMax优化广场／最优生活塔Alpha; 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10 分钟; 1 巧克力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+5 基础好感度; 5次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">学习研究</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">认知优化学院; 已知 (25); 智力 35</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">150 分钟; −35 精力; −20 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+10 基础好感度; 研究; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">问题框定</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">认知优化学院; 朋友 (100); 智力 45; 有用的错误</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45分钟；开始时需有12精力、5镇定，两者均不扣除。</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+8 直接好感度; 感知 +1; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">我为何通过选拔</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">认知优化学院; 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75 分钟; −15 精力; −5 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">空闲时间</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">认知优化学院／最优生活塔Alpha; 亲密朋友 (200); 我为何通过选拔</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75 分钟; −10 精力; +10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">娱乐点数约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">认知优化学院; 亲密朋友 (200); 同届评审; 学院 08:00–11:00 或 15:00–18:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $100; −30 精力; +10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +5 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">这件事不计分</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">认知优化学院; 迷恋 (400); 空闲时间</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90 分钟; −20 精力; −10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">非预定夜间约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">最优生活塔Alpha; 浪漫感 (800); 依恋变异; 居住塔 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $120; −35 精力; +10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +5 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私密时光</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">最优生活塔Alpha; 亲密 (1600); 一万四千小时; 这件事不计分; 居住塔 20:00–24:00; 完整版</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −30 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">私人相聚；1次/日</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>交谈、书籍与巧克力行动在不同地点共用每日次数。研究课程与问题框定只在学院提供；空闲时间则可在学院或居住塔进行。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：关系加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。标为直接好感度的一次性奖励按表中数值加入。</p><p>智力 85; 感知 80; 沟通 75</p><p>偏好技能：研究</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。表中耗时与资源为基础值；适用技能、难度及当前加成可能改变界面显示的消耗或好感度。基础好感度、直接好感度、玩家情欲经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>居住塔没有肖像时，先完成临时职位分配，并在 20:00 后回访。</li><li>娱乐约会受学院日程限制，只能在 08:00–11:00 或 15:00–18:00 开始。</li><li>后续事件未触发时，请依导航表检查前一事件、指定谈心与目的地。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="skills.html">研究技能与课程</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Prime 路线</a></li><li><a href="character-tiffany.html">Tiffany</a></li></ul></section>
